{
  "code": 200,
  "data": {
    "uid": 91028,
    "name": [
      {
        "lang": "zh",
        "text": "小狐狸没有跑走"
      },
      {
        "lang": "en",
        "text": "The fox did not run away"
      }
    ],
    "paragraphBlueprintNid": "recount_full",
    "blueprint": {
      "nid": "recount_full",
      "name": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "把经过写完整"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Tell the Whole Event"
        }
      ],
      "description": [
        {
          "lang": "zh",
          "text": "先交代时间和地点，再按顺序写经过，有变化也可以写出来，最后写结果或感受。"
        },
        {
          "lang": "en",
          "text": "Set the time and place, tell what happened in order, add a change if there is one, and end with the result or how you felt."
        }
      ],
      "paragraphTypeNid": "recount",
      "difficulty": {
        "max": 4,
        "min": 2
      },
      "order": 2,
      "minSentenceCount": 4,
      "maxSentenceCount": 7,
      "slots": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "beatNid": "opening",
          "required": true,
          "repeatMin": 1,
          "repeatMax": 1,
          "allowedDiscourseRoleNids": [
            "scene_setting"
          ],
          "allowedFamilyNids": [
            "location_and_time",
            "action_and_experience"
          ],
          "allowedPairTypeNidToNext": "sequence_pair",
          "jobName": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "交代时间地点"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Set time and place"
            }
          ],
          "jobDescription": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "先交代那一次是在什么时候、什么地方，必要时点出有谁。让读者知道你要讲的是已经发生过的一件事。"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "First say when and where that time was, and who was there if it matters. A reader should know you are telling something that already happened."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "beatNid": "develop",
          "required": true,
          "repeatMin": 2,
          "repeatMax": 4,
          "allowedDiscourseRoleNids": [
            "supporting_detail",
            "process_step"
          ],
          "allowedFamilyNids": [
            "action_and_experience",
            "location_and_time"
          ],
          "allowedPairTypeNidToNext": "sequence_pair",
          "jobName": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "按顺序写经过"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Tell it in order"
            }
          ],
          "jobDescription": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "按发生的顺序把经过写下去：先怎样、后来怎样。一件事接一件事，不要跳到说明做法或发表观点。"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Tell what happened in order: first this, then that. Stay with the events; do not switch into how-to steps or an opinion."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "beatNid": "turn",
          "required": false,
          "repeatMin": 0,
          "repeatMax": 1,
          "allowedDiscourseRoleNids": [
            "contrast_sentence",
            "result_sentence"
          ],
          "allowedFamilyNids": [
            "action_and_experience",
            "reason_and_result"
          ],
          "allowedPairTypeNidToNext": "sequence_pair",
          "jobName": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "写意外转折"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "Write the turn"
            }
          ],
          "jobDescription": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "如果有变化、意外或转折，就写在这里：事情跟预想不一样的那一下。没有的话这一拍可以空着。"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "If something changed or went unexpected, write that shift here. If nothing turned, this beat may stay empty."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "beatNid": "close",
          "required": true,
          "repeatMin": 1,
          "repeatMax": 1,
          "allowedDiscourseRoleNids": [
            "result_sentence",
            "concluding_sentence",
            "opinion_statement"
          ],
          "allowedFamilyNids": [
            "action_and_experience",
            "reason_and_result",
            "comparison_and_evaluation"
          ],
          "allowedPairTypeNidToNext": null,
          "jobName": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "写结果感受"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "End with the result"
            }
          ],
          "jobDescription": [
            {
              "lang": "zh",
              "text": "写这件事的结果，或你当时的感受。收在「那一次」上，不要改口去讲以后常常怎么做。"
            },
            {
              "lang": "en",
              "text": "End with the result or how you felt that time. Stay with that one occasion; do not switch into how it is usually done."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
